<title>HONG KONG: Shun Shing interim net loss HK$16.78 mln.</title>
<headline>Shun Shing interim net loss HK$16.78 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended February 28</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.02 loss  vs  0.01 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    16.78 loss vs  9.78 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     327.31     vs  499.22</p>
<p>    Company name		 Shun Shing Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  July 3-8</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Shun Shing is a construction and property development firm.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one-for-five shares held subject to approval at a special general meeting.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
